~$*

# Full database dumps — these contain user emails and password hashes and must
# never be committed.
/backups/
/backup.json
/backup-*.json
*.dump
*.sql

# Catalog snapshot from backup.sh. Currently REDUNDANT with the committed pmt_data
# packs (build.sh rebuilds the DB from those on every deploy), so it's ignored to
# avoid an 851 KB blob churning on every backup run.
# RED FLAG — revisit this the moment questions can be authored via the web app /
# Django admin: those questions live ONLY in the database, so this snapshot (and DB
# backups generally) stop being redundant and become the sole record of that content.
pmt_data/catalog_backup.json
